  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Madagascar &#x2013; Responsible knitwear production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a loan of the DGGF Klexknit Holding BV will be able to invest in more efficient production of knitwear and the use of renewable thermal energy in Madagascar.The investments lead to the retention of employment (the group employs 6.000 fte of which mainly women) and create ~650 new jobs (finally aiming for 1.800 additional positions by 2029).</narrative>
  </description>
